------------

Practical index setup for the separate table:
sql-- Partial HNSW index per model (pgvector 0.5+)
CREATE INDEX ON chunk_embeddings USING hnsw (embedding vector_cosine_ops)
  WHERE model = 'openai-large';

CREATE INDEX ON chunk_embeddings USING hnsw (embedding vector_cosine_ops)
  WHERE model = 'qwen3-embed';
Query stays clean:
sqlSELECT c.content, e.embedding <=> $1 AS distance
FROM chunk_embeddings e
JOIN document_chunks c ON c.id = e.chunk_id
WHERE e.model = 'qwen3-embed'
ORDER BY distance
LIMIT 10;
